// A degenerate, easily-evaded detection: alerting on one exact SHA256
// value only ever matches this one sample, never the technique itself --
// static_gate.py's hash_predicate check rejects this shape. Used to prove
// local import still catalogs an "improper" KQL rule rather than
// silently dropping it, with the reason surfaced clearly.
DeviceFileEvents
| where SHA256 == "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa"
